the Regional Electricity Companies' agreement with Nuclear Electric forming part of the qualifying arrangements to meet the Nuclear Non-Fossil Fuel Obligation;
the coal purchase contracts between the British Coal Corporation and National Power and PowerGen;
the qualifying arrangements to meet the renewables Non-Fossil Fuel Obligation, and the arrangements relating to the Non-Fossil Purchasing Agency Lid.;
the Grid and Distribution Codes;
the arrangements involving Electricité de France;
the British Grid Systems Agreement;
the Pooling and Settlement Agreement;
the Master Connection and Use of System Agreement and the connection and use of system agreements;
the initial contracts for differences.

